Getting Started

First add this project as a dependency to your <code>build.zig.zon</code> file:

```zig
.{
    // ...

<code>.dependencies = .{
    // ...

    .kdbx = .{
        .url = "https://github.com/r4gus/kdbx/archive/master.tar.gz",
        .hash = &lt;hash&gt;,
    }
},

